{"caption":"A continuous forward-tracking view steadily moves along an elevated pedestrian bridge path. Its reddish-brown deck narrows toward the horizon, bordered by grey metal railings, while lush green trees crowd the left side. Ahead, a cluster of modern office buildings rises under a bright sun, reflective glass cubes and dark-brick towers catching light, while a prominent lens flare glows in the upper right and scattered clouds drift across a blue sky above the city.

As the viewpoint advances, the deck and railings grow larger and slide toward the frame edges. The left-side foliage thickens near the camera, while the road and grassy verge below the right railing become more prominent. The distant buildings and sun flare remain roughly centered, shifting only slightly, so the scene reads as steady forward movement along the bridge, not a turn.

No people or vehicles occupy the walkway itself, keeping the perspective clean. A slender lamp post beside the left railing stays visible, and the bright sun continues to wash the glass facades with warm, hazy light, casting soft shadows.","length_note":""}
